## Configuration

The main config lives in `configs/config.yaml`. For local overrides (secrets, local paths), create `configs/config.local.yaml` — it is gitignored.

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in your values. `.env` is gitignored.

---

## Logging

Logging is configured via `configs/logging.yaml` and loaded automatically on the first call to `get_logger`. Falls back to console + dated file handler if the YAML is missing.

```python
from {{ project_name }}.utils.logger import get_logger

logger = get_logger(__name__)
logger.info("Starting process")
```

Logs are written to `logs/` (gitignored). The file handler rotates at 10 MB, keeping 5 backups.

