## CI/CD

| Workflow | Trigger | What it does |
|---|---|---|
| `ci.yml` | push / PR to `main` | lint, format check, tests |
| `cd.yml` | manual (`workflow_dispatch`) | build & push Docker image to GHCR |

To enable automatic CD on version tags, uncomment the `push` block in `.github/workflows/cd.yml` and push a tag:

```bash
git tag v1.0.0 && git push origin v1.0.0
```

